flowchart TD
    User([ユーザー])

    subgraph GitHub
        Repo[my-website\nmain branch]
        Actions[GitHub Actions]
    end

    subgraph AWS
        subgraph DNS/TLS
            Route53[Route53]
            ACM[ACM 証明書\nus-east-1]
        end

        subgraph CDN
            CF[CloudFront]
        end

        subgraph Storage
            S3[S3 Bucket\nプライベート\n静的HTML格納]
        end

        subgraph IAM
            OIDC[GitHub OIDC\nProvider]
            Role[IAM Role\n最小権限]
        end
    end

    User -->|HTTPS| Route53
    Route53 -->|Alias| CF
    ACM -.->|TLS証明書| CF
    CF -->|OAC| S3

    Repo -->|push| Actions
    Actions -->|OIDC認証| OIDC
    OIDC --> Role
    Role -->|s3 sync| S3
    Role -->|invalidation /*| CF
